          "body": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<title>Enamel Mug 12oz — Foundry Goods</title>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://gateway-clean.example/products/enamel-mug-12oz\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"text/markdown\" href=\"https://gateway-clean.example/products/enamel-mug-12oz.md\">\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"A 12-ounce speckled enamel mug with a rolled steel rim.\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Product\",\"name\":\"Enamel Mug 12oz\",\"sku\":\"FG-MUG-12\",\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"Foundry Goods\"},\"description\":\"A 12-ounce speckled enamel mug with a rolled steel rim.\",\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"24.00\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header><nav><a href=\"/\">Home</a> <a href=\"/collections/drinkware\">Drinkware</a> <a href=\"/pages/about\">About</a></nav></header>\n<main>\n<h1>Enamel Mug 12oz</h1>\n<p class=\"price\">$24.00</p>\n<p class=\"variant\">Enamel Mug 16oz — $28.00 — backordered, ships in 3 weeks</p>\n<p class=\"stock\">In stock</p>\n<p>Speckled enamel over a steel core with a rolled rim, so it survives a tailgate and a campfire. Camp-safe, dishwasher-shy.</p>\n<p>Free shipping over $50. 30-day returns.</p>\n<p class=\"review\">\"Third season on mine and the rim still looks new.\" — Dana R.</p>\n<form action=\"/cart/add\" method=\"post\"><button type=\"submit\">Add to cart</button></form>\n</main>\n<footer><p>Foundry Goods, Columbus, Ohio.</p></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
